1	# Data Model: P-RF08 — Proactive insights (mechanism)
2	
3	Source: spec.md §Key Entities/§Requirements; requirements.md §§1 (RF08), 6.3 (`chat-insight-create`), 9, 10
4	(fixed parameters), 13; `docs/input/backend/api/openapi.yaml`'s `/chat/sessions/{id}/insight` POST schema;
5	`docs/input/prototype/prototype-extract.md` §2.2 ("Tela 1 — Insight") and `cerne-prototype.html`'s own
6	`msg.isInsight` markup; `.specify/memory/constitution.md`. Extends one already-existing feature folder
7	(`lib/features/chat/`) and two `core/` files (`design_tokens.dart`, `routing/app_router.dart`) — no new feature
8	folder, no new DI registration (`createInsight` is reached through the already-registered `ChatRepository`).
9	
10	## `InsightTriggerType` / `InsightTrigger` / `InsightTriggerKeyBuilder` (`lib/features/chat/domain/entities/insight_trigger.dart`) — NEW
11	
12	```dart
13	/// FR-002's two trigger kinds. Wire-format mapping (`message_count`/
14	/// `inactivity`) lives in `ChatRemoteDataSource` only — this enum carries no
15	/// backend-shape knowledge (RNF06/Principle V).
16	enum InsightTriggerType { messageCount, inactivity }
17	
18	/// One occurrence of a satisfied trigger condition — either about to be
19	/// attempted immediately, or deferred (FR-003) until the current turn
20	/// resolves. Equatable only for test convenience; never compared in
21	/// production logic beyond null-checks (research.md R5).
22	class InsightTrigger extends Equatable {
23	  const InsightTrigger({required this.type, required this.triggerKey});
24	  final InsightTriggerType type;
25	  final String triggerKey;
26	  @override
27	  List<Object?> get props => [type, triggerKey];
28	}
29	
30	/// Pure, stateless `triggerKey` formatting (FR-002; research.md R2) — no
31	/// `package:flutter`, no network/storage access.
32	class InsightTriggerKeyBuilder {
33	  const InsightTriggerKeyBuilder._();
34	  static String forMessageCount(int count) => 'message_count:$count';
35	  static String forInactivity(DateTime firedAt) =>
36	      'inactivity:${firedAt.toUtc().toIso8601String()}';
37	}
38	```
39	
40	## `ProactiveInsight` (`lib/features/chat/domain/entities/proactive_insight.dart`) — NEW
41	
42	```dart
43	/// The single visible card at any one time (FR-004) — ephemeral, never
44	/// persisted or reconstructed (FR-009; spec.md Key Entities). `anchorIndex`
45	/// is `ChatReady.messages.length` captured the instant generation actually
46	/// started (research.md R5) — the slot `home_chat_shell_page.dart`'s
47	/// `ListView.builder` renders this card into, ahead of whatever message sat
48	/// at that index when the attempt began.
49	class ProactiveInsight extends Equatable {
50	  const ProactiveInsight({required this.content, required this.anchorIndex});
51	  final String content;
52	  final int anchorIndex;
53	  @override
54	  List<Object?> get props => [content, anchorIndex];
55	}
56	```
57	
58	No `package:flutter`/`chat/data/` import on either new domain file (RNF06/Principle V).
59	
60	## `ChatRepository`/`ChatRepositoryImpl`/`ChatRemoteDataSource` — EXTENDED
61	
62	```dart
63	abstract class ChatRepository {
64	  // createSession / listSessions / cachedSessions / listMessages / cachedMessages /
65	  // setLastActiveSessionId / lastActiveSessionId / sendMessage / retryMessage /
66	  // savedEntryIdFor / recordMessageSaved — unchanged
67	
68	  /// `POST /chat/sessions/:id/insight` (`chat-insight-create`). `Right(content)`
69	  /// only for `status: 'ready'`; every other outcome — a transport failure,
70	  /// or a 200 response with `status: 'failed'` — is `Left` (research.md R7).
71	  /// Retries once via `SessionRepository.refresh()` on `AuthExpiredFailure`,
72	  /// the same shape as every other non-streaming call (research.md R7).
73	  /// Never reads or writes any local cache — nothing about an insight is
74	  /// ever persisted (FR-009).
75	  Future<Either<Failure, String>> createInsight({
76	    required String sessionId,
77	    required InsightTriggerType triggerType,
78	    required String triggerKey,
79	  });
80	}
81	```
82	
83	`ChatRemoteDataSource`:
84	
85	```dart
86	Future<Either<Failure, String>> createInsight({
87	  required String sessionId,
88	  required InsightTriggerType triggerType,
89	  required String triggerKey,
90	}) async {
91	  final result = await _apiClient.call(
92	    'chat-insight-create',
93	    method: 'POST',
94	    pathSegments: [sessionId],
95	    body: {
96	      'triggerType': _wireTriggerType(triggerType),
97	      'triggerKey': triggerKey,
98	    },
99	  );
100	  return result.flatMap(_parseInsightContent);
101	}
102	
103	String _wireTriggerType(InsightTriggerType type) => switch (type) {
104	  InsightTriggerType.messageCount => 'message_count',
105	  InsightTriggerType.inactivity => 'inactivity',
106	};
107	
108	// research.md R7 — collapses the 200-response `status: 'failed'` outcome
109	// into the same `Left` channel every transport failure already uses.
110	Either<Failure, String> _parseInsightContent(Map<String, dynamic> data) {
111	  try {
112	    if (data['status'] as String? == 'ready') {
113	      return Right(data['content'] as String);
114	    }
115	    return Left(
116	      ErrorMapper.fromResponse({
117	        'code': data['errorCode'],
118	        'message': 'Proactive insight generation failed',
119	        'requestId': data['id'],
120	      }),
121	    );
122	  } on TypeError {
123	    return const Left(_malformedChatFailure);
124	  }
125	}
126	```
127	
128	`ChatRepositoryImpl` (no local-cache field, no new constructor dependency — reuses the existing
129	`_retryAfterSilentRefreshIfExpired<T>` helper, FR-009's "never persisted" needing zero storage interaction):
130	
131	```dart
132	@override
133	Future<Either<Failure, String>> createInsight({
134	  required String sessionId,
135	  required InsightTriggerType triggerType,
136	  required String triggerKey,
137	}) => _retryAfterSilentRefreshIfExpired(
138	  () => _remoteDataSource.createInsight(
139	    sessionId: sessionId,
140	    triggerType: triggerType,
141	    triggerKey: triggerKey,
142	  ),
143	);
144	```
145	
146	See `contracts/chat-repository-insight-extension.md` for the full test-scenario table.
147	
148	## `ChatEvent`/`ChatState`/`ChatBloc` — EXTENDED
149	
150	New events:
151	
152	| Event | When |
153	|---|---|
154	| `ChatForegroundChanged(bool isForegrounded)` | App backgrounded/resumed, drawer opened/closed, or Records/Settings pushed/popped (research.md R10) — all treated identically. |
155	| `InsightInactivityTimerFired(DateTime firedAt)` | The 2-minute single-shot `Timer` elapses (research.md R4). |
156	| `InsightDismissed()` | Tapping the card's "x" (FR-008). |
157	
158	```dart
159	class ChatForegroundChanged extends ChatEvent {
160	  const ChatForegroundChanged(this.isForegrounded);
161	  final bool isForegrounded;
162	  @override List<Object?> get props => [isForegrounded];
163	}
164	
165	class InsightInactivityTimerFired extends ChatEvent {
166	  const InsightInactivityTimerFired(this.firedAt);
167	  final DateTime firedAt;
168	  @override List<Object?> get props => [firedAt];
169	}
170	
171	class InsightDismissed extends ChatEvent {
172	  const InsightDismissed();
173	}
174	```
175	
176	`ChatReady` gains one new field:
177	
178	```dart
179	class ChatReady extends ChatState {
180	  const ChatReady({
181	    required this.sessionId,
182	    required this.messages,
183	    required this.isOffline,
184	    required this.awaitingResponse,
185	    this.loadFailure,
186	    this.bookmarks = const {},
187	    this.insight,                      // NEW — ProactiveInsight?, null = no card visible
188	  });
189	
190	  // ...existing fields...
191	  final ProactiveInsight? insight;
192	
193	  // copyWith(...) gains `ProactiveInsight? insight` + `bool clearInsight = false`,
194	  // the same `clearSessionId`-style boolean-flag shape already used for `sessionId`
195	  // (never the `_unset`-sentinel shape used for `loadFailure`, since `insight`'s
196	  // "clear" case — dismissal — is a named, common operation, not a rare default-preserving one).
197	  // props gains `insight`.
198	}
199	```
200	
201	`ChatBloc` gains one new constructor parameter (no new dependency — only a testability seam, research.md R4)
202	and three new handlers; it is otherwise unchanged in its dependency surface:
203	
204	```dart
205	class ChatBloc extends Bloc<ChatEvent, ChatState> {
206	  ChatBloc({
207	    required ChatRepository chatRepository,
208	    required ConnectivityChecker connectivityChecker,
209	    required CreateEntryUseCase createEntryUseCase,
210	    Duration insightInactivityTimeout = const Duration(minutes: 2),   // NEW
211	  }) : ... {
212	    // ...existing on<...> registrations...
213	    on<ChatForegroundChanged>(_onForegroundChanged);                 // NEW
214	    on<InsightInactivityTimerFired>(_onInsightInactivityTimerFired);  // NEW
215	    on<InsightDismissed>(_onInsightDismissed);                       // NEW
216	  }
217	
218	  final Duration _insightInactivityTimeout;
219	
220	  // Insight mechanism bookkeeping — private, never part of ChatState (research.md R1).
221	  int _insightMessageCount = 0;
222	  bool _insightInFlight = false;
223	  InsightTrigger? _pendingInsightTrigger;
224	  int _insightGeneration = 0;
225	  bool _isForegrounded = true;
226	  Timer? _inactivityTimer;
227	
228	  bool get _insightSuspended =>
229	      _insightInFlight ||
230	      _pendingInsightTrigger != null ||
231	      (state case ChatReady(insight: final i) when i != null => true, _ => false);
232	}
233	```
234	
235	Core helpers:
236	
237	```dart
238	// Conversation (re)opened — FR-009's "counters start fresh" moment.
239	// Called from _onStarted / _onConversationSelected / _onNewConversationRequested,
240	// right before emitting the fresh ChatReady.
241	void _resetInsightMechanism() {
242	  _insightGeneration++;
243	  _insightMessageCount = 0;
244	  _insightInFlight = false;
245	  _pendingInsightTrigger = null;
246	  _inactivityTimer?.cancel();
247	}
248	
249	void _armInactivityTimer() {
250	  _inactivityTimer?.cancel();
251	  if (!_isForegrounded || _insightSuspended) return;
252	  _inactivityTimer = Timer(
253	    _insightInactivityTimeout,
254	    () => add(InsightInactivityTimerFired(DateTime.now())),
255	  );
256	}
257	
258	void _onForegroundChanged(ChatForegroundChanged event, Emitter<ChatState> emit) {
259	  _isForegrounded = event.isForegrounded;
260	  if (!_isForegrounded) {
261	    _inactivityTimer?.cancel();
262	    return;
263	  }
264	  _armInactivityTimer(); // FR-010 — always a fresh 2 minutes, never a resumed partial count
265	}
266	
267	Future<void> _onInsightInactivityTimerFired(
268	  InsightInactivityTimerFired event,
269	  Emitter<ChatState> emit,
270	) async {
271	  final current = state;
272	  if (current is! ChatReady || current.sessionId == null) return; // research.md R6
273	  if (_insightSuspended) return; // defensive — the timer is cancelled the instant suspension begins
274	  final trigger = InsightTrigger(
275	    type: InsightTriggerType.inactivity,
276	    triggerKey: InsightTriggerKeyBuilder.forInactivity(event.firedAt),
277	  );
278	  if (current.awaitingResponse) {
279	    _pendingInsightTrigger ??= trigger; // FR-003 — defer until the turn resolves
280	    return;
281	  }
282	  await _startInsightAttempt(trigger, sessionId: current.sessionId!, emit: emit);
283	}
284	
285	void _onInsightDismissed(InsightDismissed event, Emitter<ChatState> emit) {
286	  final current = state;
287	  if (current is! ChatReady || current.insight == null) return;
288	  emit(current.copyWith(clearInsight: true));
289	  _armInactivityTimer(); // FR-004/FR-008 — suspension ends, fresh window starts
290	}
291	
292	Future<void> _startInsightAttempt(
293	  InsightTrigger trigger, {
294	  required String sessionId,
295	  required Emitter<ChatState> emit,
296	}) async {
297	  _inactivityTimer?.cancel();
298	  _pendingInsightTrigger = null;
299	  _insightInFlight = true;
300	  final generation = _insightGeneration;
301	  final anchorIndex = (state as ChatReady).messages.length;
302	
303	  if (!await _connectivityChecker.hasConnection()) {
304	    _insightInFlight = false; // FR-007 — never attempted; resolved like a failure
305	    if (generation == _insightGeneration) _armInactivityTimer();
306	    return;
307	  }
308	
309	  final result = await _chatRepository.createInsight(
310	    sessionId: sessionId,
311	    triggerType: trigger.type,
312	    triggerKey: trigger.triggerKey,
313	  );
314	
315	  _insightInFlight = false;
316	  if (generation != _insightGeneration) return; // stale — conversation switched away mid-flight
317	
318	  final latest = state;
319	  if (latest is! ChatReady) return;
320	
321	  result.match(
322	    (failure) {
323	      if (failure is AuthExpiredFailure) _reauthController.add(null);
324	      _armInactivityTimer(); // FR-006 — no card, no indicator; occurrence fully resolved
325	    },
326	    (content) => emit(
327	      latest.copyWith(insight: ProactiveInsight(content: content, anchorIndex: anchorIndex)),
328	    ),
329	  );
330	}
331	
332	// Called once per turn resolution — the end of _consumeTurn (after
333	// _reconcileSilentFailure) and inside _failTurn, both now `Future<void>`.
334	Future<void> _onTurnResolved(String sessionId, Emitter<ChatState> emit) async {
335	  final hadPending = _pendingInsightTrigger != null;
336	  final trigger = _pendingInsightTrigger;
337	  if (trigger != null) {
338	    final current = state;
339	    if (current is ChatReady && !current.awaitingResponse) {
340	      await _startInsightAttempt(trigger, sessionId: sessionId, emit: emit);
341	    }
342	  }
343	  // Only re-arm here if a deferred trigger just finished resolving without a
344	  // card (failed/skipped) — a turn with no pending trigger leaves whatever
345	  // timer _onMessageSubmitted already armed at send-time alone (research.md R4).
346	  if (hadPending && !_insightSuspended) _armInactivityTimer();
347	}
348	```
349	
350	Extensions to existing handlers:
351	
352	- **`_onStarted` / `_onConversationSelected` / `_onNewConversationRequested`**: each calls
353	  `_resetInsightMechanism()` before emitting its fresh `ChatReady` (which never passes `insight:`, so it
354	  defaults to `null`), then `_armInactivityTimer()` right after.
355	- **`_onMessageSubmitted`**: immediately after building `optimisticUser`/`optimisticAssistant`, insert:
356	  ```dart
357	  if (!_insightSuspended) {
358	    _insightMessageCount++;
359	    if (_insightMessageCount % 5 == 0) {
360	      _pendingInsightTrigger ??= InsightTrigger(
361	        type: InsightTriggerType.messageCount,
362	        triggerKey: InsightTriggerKeyBuilder.forMessageCount(_insightMessageCount),
363	      );
364	    }
365	  }
366	  _armInactivityTimer(); // FR-001b — resets "time since last message sent" now
367	  ```
368	  then, at the point `_consumeTurn` is awaited (both the brand-new-session and existing-session branches),
369	  nothing else changes — `_consumeTurn` itself now calls `_onTurnResolved` internally (below).
370	- **`_consumeTurn`**: after the existing `await _reconcileSilentFailure(emit, sessionId, assistantId,
371	  generation);` line, add `if (generation == _turnGeneration) await _onTurnResolved(sessionId, emit);` (the
372	  existing `_turnGeneration` guard, not `_insightGeneration` — a stale/abandoned turn should not trigger a fresh
373	  insight attempt on behalf of a conversation no longer active).
374	- **`_failTurn`**: becomes `Future<void> _failTurn(...)`, and after its existing `emit(_applyFailure(...))`
375	  line, adds `await _onTurnResolved(sessionId, emit);` — both call sites (`_onMessageSubmitted`'s and
376	  `_retryLazySessionCreation`'s lazy-`createSession`-failure branches) are updated to `await _failTurn(...)`.
377	- **`close()`**: adds `_inactivityTimer?.cancel();` alongside the existing subscription/controller cleanup.
378	
379	See `contracts/chat-bloc-insight-extension.md` for the full handler listing and test-scenario table.
380	
381	## Widgets — `insight_card.dart` (NEW), `home_chat_shell_page.dart` (extended), `app_router.dart` (extended)
382	
383	```dart
384	class InsightCard extends StatelessWidget {
385	  const InsightCard({required this.content, required this.onDismiss, super.key});
386	  final String content;
387	  final VoidCallback onDismiss;
388	}
389	```
390	
391	Renders the prototype's exact markup — full-width (no 82%-max-width bound, unlike a message bubble), a 3 dp
392	ochre spine on the left edge via a `Stack`+`Positioned`, "INSIGHT" (`textMonoCaption.copyWith(colorAccent)`) and
393	a `Icons.close` dismiss glyph (`sizeInsightDismissIcon`, `colorTextSecondary`) on one row, the generated text
394	below (`textBodyMd`, unmodified) — see research.md R12 for the exact token mapping.
395	
396	`home_chat_shell_page.dart`'s `ListView.builder`:
397	
398	```dart
399	final insight = chatReady?.insight;
400	...
401	ListView.builder(
402	  itemCount: messages.length + (insight == null ? 0 : 1),
403	  itemBuilder: (context, index) {
404	    if (insight != null && index == insight.anchorIndex) {
